WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.713
Connect your hospital portal, like MyChart. You sign in on the hospital's page, so we never see your password.

2
00:00:07.863 --> 00:00:15.587
Your labs, medicines, allergies and appointments arrive in one place. The AI explains them in simple words.

3
00:00:15.737 --> 00:00:22.736
Each item stays private until you share it with the family. You can also upload a bill to understand the charges.
